+    // the camera frame keeps only its corners and its two fixed chips; the activity ticker (who ran what, the cost, raw
+    // error text), the feed and rec readouts and anything added to it later are not drawn; nor are the dock's minimized-
+    // window chips (session titles), and the topbar's hidden focused-agent/model fields stay hidden whatever comes later
+    'body.sn-viewer #stage-wrap .cam-hud > :not(.cam-c):not(.cam-cine):not(.cam-mode), body.sn-viewer #term-strip, body.sn-viewer #gt-agent, body.sn-viewer #gt-model { display: none !important; }',
+    'body.sn-viewer #crew { max-height: none !important; flex: 1 1 auto !important; }',
+    'body.sn-viewer .viewer-note { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 48px; padding: 10px; letter-spacing: .22em; opacity: .5; }',
